             Summary: `awaitProcessableTasks` is not safe in the presence o=
f spurious wakeups.=E2=80=9D
                 Key: KAFKA-17929
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17929
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Ao Li


According to JDK, `await` can be unblocked due to spurious wakeups https://=
docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/util/concurrent/locks/Condition.html

Currently `DefaultTaskManager::awaitProcessableTasks` does not handle this =
scenario. Branch https://github.com/aoli-al/kafka/tree/KAFKA-82 shows a fai=
ling test because of this=20

Command: ./gradlew :streams:test --tests DefaultTaskManagerTest.shouldBlock=
OnAwait



