Shivsundar R resolved KAFKA-17819.
----------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Handle acknowledgements when subscription changes.
> --------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17819
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17819
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>            Reporter: Shivsundar R
>            Assignee: Shivsundar R
>            Priority: Major
>
> Currently after we receive a ShareFetch response, if the subscription changes, then we do not acknowledge the records which are not part of the updated subscription. Instead we must acknowledge all the records that we had received irrespective of the current subscription.



--
