Hi All,

Thanks for the inputs. I have updated the KIP based on the discussion so fa=
r.

Few of the changes:
1. I have updated the KIP to use ISO-8601 format for defining duration.
2. Add support for the earliest-local option, which will reset to
local-log-start-offset.
2. Changes to ConsumerGroupCommand to support reset to earliest-local
3. Add new config option support to Kafka Streams

I have adopted the changes suggested by Andrew to add a new config to
set the duration (auto.offset.reset.by.duration).
Let me know your thoughts.

Thanks

