Hi D=C3=A1niel,

Thanks for the review,

DU1,DU2: Based on suggestions, I have updated the config option to
support ISO format.

DU3: We will compute the timestamp on the client side and use that
timestamp to fetch the offset from the server. This will be similar to
the kafka-consumer-group cmd's  --by-duration reset option.


Thanks,


