Colin McCabe resolved KAFKA-17870.
----------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.0.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> Disallow creating too many partitions before using ReplicaPlacer
> ----------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17870
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17870
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Colin McCabe
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.0.0
>
>
> A single CreateTopics operation can't create more than 10,000 partitions because the batch would have too many records in it. We should check for this situation before trying to place the replicas for all the partitions, to minimize resource use in this case.



--
