Apoorv Mittal created KAFKA-17951:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Rotate share partitions in share fetch
                 Key: KAFKA-17951
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17951
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Apoorv Mittal
            Assignee: Apoorv Mittal


As per KIP we should rotate the fetch partitions

=C2=A0

[https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D2550704=
34#KIP932:QueuesforKafka-Fetchingandacknowledgingrecords]

=C2=A0

_In order to ensure no share-partitions are starved from records being fetc=
hed, the share-partition leader rotates the order of share-partitions for w=
hich it returns partition information. This ensures that it eventually retu=
rns data about all partitions for which data is available._



