Hi Jun,

Thanks for the Review.

JR1: makes sense. We felt earliest_local can be useful in certain use
cases. I think we can ignore it for now and add back when we have a
clear use case.

JR2: Agree. KIP-842 additionally allows to set different reset
strategies for initial offset missing and out of range scenarios.

Thanks,

