             Summary: TransactionsTest.testSendOffsetsWithGroupId fails wit=
h CONSUMER group protocol
                 Key: KAFKA-17964
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17964
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: admin, clients, consumer
    Affects Versions: 3.9.0
