             Fix For: 4.0.0


When executing the {{TransactionsBounceTest}}'s {{testWithGroupId()}} using=
 the {{CONSUMER}} group protocol, it fails with the error:

{quote}{color:#FF0000}Transaction offset Commit failed due to consumer grou=
p metadata mismatch: The coordinator is not aware of this member.{color}
{quote}
