Sean Quah created KAFKA-17965:
---------------------------------

             Summary: New group coordinator request local time excludes coordinator processing
                 Key: KAFKA-17965
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17965
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: group-coordinator
            Reporter: Sean Quah


The local time for requests is computed as the time spent in the request handler thread. The new group coordinator does its processing in its own thread pool. This processing time is not included in the local time and ends up falling under remote time, which is misleading.



