     [ https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14057?page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:all-tabpanel ]

Colin McCabe resolved KAFKA-14057.
----------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 3.5.0
       Resolution: Fixed

This was fixed a long time ago, starting in 3.5 (although it took us a while to support absolutely every dynamic configuration key.)

> Support dynamic reconfiguration in KRaft remote controllers
> -----------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-14057
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14057
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Task
>            Reporter: Ron Dagostino
>            Assignee: Colin McCabe
>            Priority: Major
>              Labels: 4.0-blocker
>             Fix For: 3.5.0
>
>
> We currently do not support dynamic reconfiguration of KRaft remote controllers.  We only wire up brokers and react to metadata log changes there.  We do no such wiring or reacting in a node where process.roles=controller.  Related to https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14051.



--
