Colin McCabe resolved KAFKA-13142.
----------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 3.2.0
       Resolution: Fixed

This was fixed in Kafka 3.2

> KRaft brokers do not validate dynamic configs before forwarding them to controller
> ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-13142
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13142
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Task
>          Components: kraft
>    Affects Versions: 3.0.0
>            Reporter: Ryan Dielhenn
>            Assignee: Ryan Dielhenn
>            Priority: Blocker
>             Fix For: 3.2.0
>
>
> The KRaft brokers are not currently validating dynamic configs before forwarding them to the controller. To ensure that KRaft clusters are easily upgradable it would be a good idea to validate dynamic configs in the first release of KRaft so that invalid dynamic configs are never stored.



