> KRaft Controller doesn't consider brokers that are shutting down during t=
opic creating
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------=
-------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-15509
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15509
>             Project: Kafka
