>            Reporter: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio
>            Assignee: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio
>            Priority: Major
>
> The topic creation implementation in KRaft is able to user brokers that a=
re fenced as replicas during topic creations. The restriction is that the c=
ontroller won't assign leadership to those topics.
> This feature makes it possible for users to roll clusters with 3 brokers =
without sacrificing topic creation availability.
> Looking at the code it looks like the KRaft controller doesn't consider b=
rokers that are shutting down as eligible for replicas during topic creatio=
n.



