    Resolution: Invalid

Replicas aren't created "on the controller." However, the controller does m=
ediate the creation og replicas, by accepting forwarded CREATE_PARTITIONS a=
nd CREATE_TOPICS requests from the brokers.

> Kafla create replca partition on controller node
