Hi Kevin,

Thanks for your interest in Apache Kafka! In order to contribute to Apache
Kafka you need to first create a fork on your own GitHub space. There is
plenty of information on how to do this on the internet, but long story
short: go to github.com/apache/kafka and click on fork on the top right
corner.
Once you have your fork created, check this one out, create a new branch
for your task and you'll be able to push there.

A much deeper and detailed guide can be found here:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Contributing+Code+Changes

Best,

