             Summary: Fix quorum_reconfiguration_test.py=20
                 Key: KAFKA-18029
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18029
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
