hi TaiJuWu

Q0:

`Format: topic.acks`  the dot is acceptable character in topic naming, so may=
be we should reverse the format to "acks.${topic}" to get the acks of topic e=
asily

Q1: `Return Map<Acks, List<ProducerBatch>> when RecordAccumulator#drainBatche=
sForOneNode is called.`

this is weird to me, as all we need to do is pass `Map<String, Acks> to `Send=
er` and make sure `Sender#sendProduceRequest` add correct acks to ProduceRequ=
est, right?

Best,
Chia-Ping



