>> > > Proposal 1) Making topology updating optional: We modify the heartbe=
at
>> > > request to allow joining a group without sending a topology (only a
>> > > topology ID). When joining a group this way, the member is explicitl=
y
>> > > requesting to not update the topology of the group. In other words,
