----------------------------------------------

             Summary: Remove TopologyConfig and clean up Topology/StreamsBuilder config APIs
                 Key: KAFKA-18055
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18055
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: streams
