> SVV1. That 175 vs 100 seconds in the no-cache seems to be a big differenc=
e.
> There is a performance benchmark by Gradle (
> https://blog.gradle.org/gradle-vs-bazel-jvm) which might be biased from
> their side, but seems to conclude different results. One thing they menti=
on
