=80=9D in kafka-consumer-groups.sh.
> It returns =E2=80=9Ctrue=E2=80=9D if a member is in a classic group or it=
=E2=80=99s a classic
> member in a consumer group.
> In other cases, it returns =E2=80=9Cfalse=E2=80=9D.
>
> I have a draft implementation in
