Rajini Sivaram resolved KAFKA-18085.
------------------------------------
      Reviewer: Manikumar
    Resolution: Fixed

> Abort inflight requests when rebootstrapping due to timeout or error
> --------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-18085
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18085
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>          Components: clients
>            Reporter: Rajini Sivaram
>            Assignee: Rajini Sivaram
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.0.0
>
>
> We only used to rebootstrap when there were no connections and hence no inflight requests with KIP-899. During rebootstrapping for conditions added in KIP-1102, we may have existing connections with inflight requests. We should abort those requests prior to rebootstrap.



