Hi,

Generally, max production throughput will be calculated as follows:

- max_requests_per_sec =3D 1000 / request_latency_ms * 5
(max.in.flight.requests)
- max_throughput =3D max_requests_per_sec * messages-per-request

So I suggest identifying which is the bottleneck first, req-latency or
too-small-batch.
You can observe these from producer metrics.


