Hi Daniel,

SVV3. I think we can leave it as it is for now. I can't really figure out
the perfect solution for this either. Introducing yet another interface
doesn't seem like what we should do here and since the filter
implementations can be reused, it has some benefits.
I have no further questions. If we don't see any more responses in the next
few days, I think you can start a vote.

Best,
Viktor

