> The question is whether this should be part of a separate KIP.
> I don’t see any issue with integrating it into the current one, but if necessary, I’m happy to volunteer to open a new KIP.
> In both cases, would it be okay for you if I validate it with you before publishing?
> cheers !
> 
> 
