Lingnan Liu created KAFKA-18107:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Sensor Access Concurrency Enhancements
                 Key: KAFKA-18107
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18107
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Lingnan Liu


Right now, we have multiple layers of locking when it comes to updating metrics and sensors and it has become increasingly hard to reason about its thread-safety. Hence I created this ticket to track the effort of refactoring Sensor access patterns to make it easy to use and ensure thread safety at all circumstances.



--
