Manoj Mathivanan created KAFKA-18115:
----------------------------------------

             Summary: Issue loading big files for performance testing
                 Key: KAFKA-18115
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18115
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: tools
            Reporter: Manoj Mathivanan
            Assignee: Manoj Mathivanan


When performing producer performance tests, we can specify a payload using the {{*--payloadFile*}} parameter. This file is utilized during the load/performance testing process. However, if the file is large, it may result in the following error:
{code:java}
Exception in thread "main" java.lang.NegativeArraySizeException: -1040351534
	at java.base/java.lang.String.<init>(String.java:568) {code}



--
